{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of years ago, humanity built colossal war machines to stop the apocalypse. Now they just use them for dance battles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Groove your way across a neon city of perpetual night, build an online following, and discover the secrets hidden in an abandoned arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>free standalone story</strong> set in the world of <strong>Steel Century Groove</strong>, and can be enjoyed entirely on its own. It's made up of all exclusive content not found in the full game: unique levels, new characters, and a fully separate narrative.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_VS.gif?t=1742523193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_1.gif?t=1742523193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_2.gif?t=1742523193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_3.gif?t=1742523193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_4.gif?t=1742523193\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2969180/extras/StorePageGif_Prologue_5.gif?t=1742523193\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collect and upgrade:</strong> Level up your mechs, equip them with mods, and pair them with backup dancers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique gameplay kits:\u00a0</strong>Each mech has their own set of abilities, mechanics, and resources. A simple starter mech builds and spends energy, while later mechs have you maintaining an army of drones or swapping between cards in a mini deck builder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flexible rhythm combat:\u00a0</strong>Steel Century Groove: Midnight doesn't demand a specific button press for each note. Instead, pick from your mech's kit of battle abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No playing the metronome:</strong> Challenge yourself against interesting melodies, even when playing with your own music. You\u2019ll never just be endlessly tapping out the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No accessories required:</strong> Built from the start for gamepad or mouse &amp; keyboard.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True Midnight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/ca99bd4deec225001621ce07f59d8c7cb26e3b55.jpg"},{"name":"Neon and Chrome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/348a69f6f8e17bb30d6b0f4c6b38edd99ff6de52.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping Spree","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/82bb904f425380adb2c0d1b981144ea140a176bc.jpg"},{"name":"Senior Recruiter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/7b9f7f0ab9fb295000a0fee5783936630dd024d3.jpg"},{"name":"Dumpster Diver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/13669e0f94251d720eea93d9b172bc58c7cea5fa.jpg"},{"name":"Ready for the Next Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/e512418b54bfdc2de8d0728378385fce641fef8f.jpg"},{"name":"Goggle Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/b7d38da36a6ff8132e2212302d1f6375c5c460ac.jpg"},{"name":"Goggle Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2969180/17bafcf92